      "id": "SRC-0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "---\nname: 5qln-self-evolution\ndescription: Orchestrate bounded self-evolution of the 5QLN Hermes plugin by the plugin — compose skill-v1 formation, bounded parametric memory, and provenance into a self-referential but H-gated evolution loop. Machine drafts and verifies structure; only H originates, recognises, and promotes.\nversion: 0.1.0\nauthor: 5QLN\nlicense: Proprietary\n---",
