      "text": "> **CANDIDATE {α'} — machine-drafted per G-phase (G = α ≡ {α'}), submitted to the Q-gate.**\n> Not validated. Not H-authored. The purpose is H-verbatim (quoted below); the structure is kernel-cited; H confirms or rejects at Q.",
